 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are you holding up?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I grew up somewhere it never snowed and now there's ten centimetres outside. I have to drive to work.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "block": "cars.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, a few basics will make a big difference. First, clear all the snow off the car, including the roof, so it doesn't slide onto your windscreen.",
   "est_sec": 8.47,
   "gap_before": 1.15,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Even the roof? Nobody here does that.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "block": "cars.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Even the roof. Then pull away gently in second gear if you have a manual, it stops the wheels spinning.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It's an automatic.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "block": "cars.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then just be very light on the accelerator. Brake early and softly, and leave about ten times the usual gap to the car in front.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ten times? That feels like",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.37,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "a ridiculous amount.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.48,
   "block": "cars.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It does, until you need it. Stopping distances on snow are massive. And avoid sudden steering, smooth inputs are everything.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay. Slow, gentle, huge gaps.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 3.09,
   "block": "cars.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. And if the roads look really bad, it's okay to call in and work from home.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.12,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cars.dlg12"
  }
 ]
}
